      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a539c1f5925c26a2c03a1f7|full_name}: yeah.. I could, but since I don't have fps problems I would like to see the avatars (and the default gray one is appaling). The only solution I found is activating safe mode, blocking everyone, and unblocking them 1 by 1 until all of them are downloaded, it's just a frustrating process tho.",
