  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-08-27T15:18:18.978Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have a really bad connection, that however lets me play decently once all avatars in a room are downloaded, the issue I'm encountering is when I join a room with multiple people already there, and vrchat tries to download every avatar at the same time instead of one by one, this causes me to reach 3k-4k ping and get disconnected with a timeout. Could there be an option to toggle that lets you choose wether you want to load one avatar at the time instead of all of them together? It could benefit people with a poor connection by preventing them from being disconnected, and it can also be useful if someone doesn't like vrchat buffering for a long time when it loads 4-5 avatars at the same time even with a fast connection.",
